1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,723
AI will have you thinking you’re cooking.

2
00:00:02,973 --> 00:00:06,187
You tell it your business idea…

3
00:00:06,187 --> 00:00:08,684
and suddenly everything’s brilliant.

4
00:00:08,884 --> 00:00:12,008
Your strategy makes sense.

5
00:00:12,008 --> 00:00:14,053
Your plan is solid.

6
00:00:14,053 --> 00:00:16,485
You’re about to change the world.

7
00:00:17,135 --> 00:00:19,060
Meanwhile…

8
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:21,420
you ain’t sold a damn thing.

9
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:24,927
Look, AI can help you build an idea.

10
00:00:25,027 --> 00:00:28,907
But agreement ain’t validation.

11
00:00:29,707 --> 00:00:32,916
So stop asking it, “Is this a good idea?”

12
00:00:33,166 --> 00:00:35,201
Ask it, “Why would this fail?”

13
00:00:35,751 --> 00:00:37,532
“Who actually pays for this?”

14
00:00:38,082 --> 00:00:40,611
“What am I assuming that I haven’t proven?”

15
00:00:41,161 --> 00:00:42,803
And my favorite…

16
00:00:42,803 --> 00:00:45,318
“Make the strongest argument against my plan.”

17
00:00:46,018 --> 00:00:49,951
The point isn’t getting a machine to tell you you’re right.

18
00:00:50,101 --> 00:00:53,303
It’s using the machine to get better at thinking.

19
00:00:54,003 --> 00:00:54,940
Quiet Bands.

20
00:00:54,946 --> 00:00:56,683
Build what matters.

